"Correct is B: it leads with command (the plan calms), executes the operator's seat (verify, isolate, freeze), and serves the dual audience with relayable status. A is wrong: 'call back in the morning' during ransomware is the abdication. C is wrong: solo forensics instead of containment inverts the priorities. D is wrong: waking everyone before verifying and containing is panic with extra steps.",
