[["The move", "First: follow it (the lore exists for a reason \u2014 ask WHY: 'what happened on a Friday once?'). Then: propose documenting it \u2014 'mind if I add this to the runbook with the reason? Future-me will thank us.'"],
["Why it matters", "The lore-to-doc pipeline is the new hire's superpower: you see the gaps the veterans are blind to. Documenting the unwritten (with the team's blessing) is the unglamorous contribution that compounds."],
["The respect", "Propose, don't unilaterally publish: 'mind if I...' The lore belongs to the team; the documentation is your gift to it."]],
